    <main class="screen" id="screen"><div><div class="today-head"><span class="mono">Program No. 327 \xB7 Monday</span><h1>Today</h1><p>6 films, 55 minutes. It ends at midnight.</p><div style="display:grid;gap:6px"><span class="mono" style="color:var(--muted)">Time I have</span><div class="timeseg" role="group" aria-label="Time I have"><button type="button" aria-pressed="false">5 MIN</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false">10 MIN</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false">15 MIN</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="true">ALL</button></div></div></div><article class="film"><button class="art" type="button" aria-label="Play G\xF6del's incompleteness, plainly, 10 minutes"><canvas width="393" height="295"></canvas><span class="dur" style="background:#000000;color:#ffd60a">10 MIN</span></button><div class="film-body"><div class="film-meta"><span class="mono">Mathematics \xB7 4 chapters</span></div><h2 class="f-Mathematics">G\xF6del's incompleteness, plainly</h2><p>Any consistent system strong enough for arithmetic contains true statements it can't prove.</p><span class="why">\u2192\uFE0E Today's wildcard, from outside your usual subjects.</span><div class="actions"><button class="btn solid" type="button"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 4.5v15l12.5-7.5z"></path></svg>Watch</button><button class="btn icon" type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Save for later"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 3.5h12v17l-6-4.5-6 4.5z"></path></svg></button></div></div></article><article class="film"><button class="art" type="button" aria-label="Play Bayes' rule with a deck of cards, 10 minutes"><canvas width="393" height="295"></canvas><span class="dur" style="background:#000000;color:#ffd60a">10 MIN</span></button><div class="film-body"><div class="film-meta"><span class="mono">Mathematics \xB7 4 chapters</span></div><h2 class="f-Mathematics">Bayes' rule with a deck of cards</h2><p>Update a belief by exactly as much as the evidence deserves.</p><span class="why">\u2192\uFE0E Rounds out today's program.</span><div class="actions"><button class="btn solid" type="button"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 4.5v15l12.5-7.5z"></path></svg>Watch</button><button class="btn icon" type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Save for later"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 3.5h12v17l-6-4.5-6 4.5z"></path></svg></button></div></div></article><article class="film"><button class="art" type="button" aria-label="Play Why bread rises, 5 minutes"><canvas width="393" height="295"></canvas><span class="dur" style="background:#000000;color:#ff8fb1">5 MIN</span></button><div class="film-body"><div class="film-meta"><span class="mono">Chemistry \xB7 3 chapters</span></div><h2 class="f-Chemistry">Why bread rises</h2><p>Yeast makes the gas. Gluten holds it. Heat locks it in.</p><span class="why">\u2192\uFE0E Rounds out today's program.</span><div class="actions"><button class="btn solid" type="button"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 4.5v15l12.5-7.5z"></path></svg>Watch</button><button class="btn icon" type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Save for later"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 3.5h12v17l-6-4.5-6 4.5z"></path></svg></button></div></div></article><article class="film"><button class="art" type="button" aria-label="Play The Antikythera mechanism, 10 minutes"><canvas width="393" height="295"></canvas><span class="dur" style="background:#000000;color:#c9b79c">10 MIN</span></button><div class="film-body"><div class="film-meta"><span class="mono">History \xB7 4 chapters</span></div><h2 class="f-History">The Antikythera mechanism</h2><p>A shoebox of bronze gears from around 100 BCE that predicted eclipses.</p><span class="why">\u2192\uFE0E Rounds out today's program.</span><div class="actions"><button class="btn solid" type="button"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 4.5v15l12.5-7.5z"></path></svg>Watch</button><button class="btn icon" type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Save for later"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 3.5h12v17l-6-4.5-6 4.5z"></path></svg></button></div></div></article><article class="film"><button class="art" type="button" aria-label="Play The sound of a room, 5 minutes"><canvas width="393" height="295"></canvas><span class="dur" style="background:#000000;color:#ff4f1f">5 MIN</span></button><div class="film-body"><div class="film-meta"><span class="mono">Acoustics \xB7 3 chapters</span></div><h2 class="f-Acoustics">The sound of a room</h2><p>Why a cathedral blurs speech and a recording booth sounds dead.</p><span class="why">\u2192\uFE0E Rounds out today's program.</span><div class="actions"><button class="btn solid" type="button"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 4.5v15l12.5-7.5z"></path></svg>Watch</button><button class="btn icon" type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Save for later"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 3.5h12v17l-6-4.5-6 4.5z"></path></svg></button></div></div></article><article class="film"><button class="art" type="button" aria-label="Play The Golden Record, 15 minutes"><canvas width="393" height="295"></canvas><span class="dur" style="background:#ffffff;color:#000000">15 MIN</span></button><div class="film-body"><div class="film-meta"><span class="mono">Space \xB7 4 chapters</span></div><h2 class="f-Space">The Golden Record</h2><p>In 1977 two spacecraft left Earth carrying its sounds, for anyone who finds them.</p><span class="why">\u2192\uFE0E Rounds out today's program.</span><div class="actions"><button class="btn solid" type="button"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 4.5v15l12.5-7.5z"></path></svg>Watch</button><button class="btn icon" type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Save for later"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 3.5h12v17l-6-4.5-6 4.5z"></path></svg></button></div></div></article><div class="end"><b>That's the whole program.</b><span>No infinite scroll. When it's done, you're done for the day.</span></div></div></main>
